<noinclude>{{Documentationpage}}</noinclude>
Template for changing text foreground and background color. Accepts standard [[wikipedia:HTML color names|HTML color names]] or [[wikipedia:Web colors#Hex triplet|RGB hex triplets]].

==Usage==
<pre>{{color|red|text}}</pre>
<pre>{{color|#FF0000|text}}</pre>
<pre>{{color|red|text|bg=green}}</pre>

Unless used on your user page, use with great caution as a poor contrast can make the text difficult to read. Be aware that this template does not change the color of links as these are determined by site or personal settings.

===Parameters===
{{Docparam|name=&lt;unnamed 1>|req=yes|default=|desc=
[[wikipedia:HTML color names|HTML color name]] or [[wikipedia:Web colors#Hex triplet|RGB hex triplet]] of text foreground color.
}}

{{Docparam|name=&lt;unnamed 2>|req=yes|default=|desc=
Text which should be colored.
}}

{{Docparam|name=bg|req=no|default=|desc=
[[wikipedia:HTML color names|HTML color name]] or [[wikipedia:Web colors#Hex triplet|RGB hex triplet]] of text background color.
}}

==Examples==
* <code><nowiki>{{color|red|text}}</nowiki></code> results in: {{color|red|text}}
* <code><nowiki>{{color|#800080|text}}</nowiki></code> results in: {{color|#800080|text}}
* <code><nowiki>{{color|yellow|text|bg=green}}</nowiki></code> results in: {{color|yellow|text|bg=green}}
